REX developer documentation

The Markdown pages in this directory and the generated API reference are
published with MkDocs. MrDocs reads its configuration from docs/mrdocs.yml;
API documentation comments and grouping definitions live in src/docs/mrdocs.

Run scripts/build-docs to set up the documentation environment and build the
site locally. The build generates required headers, including rosePublicConfig.h
and Cxx_Grammar.h, when necessary. To place temporary output under the build
tree, use:

  DOCS_SCRATCH_DIR=build/docs-scratch scripts/build-docs

See docs/build.md for compiler build instructions and docs/api.md for the
API documentation workflow. The codebase-audit and upstream-sync directories
contain audit evidence and historical synchronization records.
